<title>LATVIA: PAREKS FINANCES RUSSIA'S KURSK REGION REPORT.</title>
<headline>PAREKS FINANCES RUSSIA'S KURSK REGION REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading Latvian bank Pareks is to provide financial services and a loan of 130 billion roubles to Russia's Kursk region, newspaper Bizness i Baltiya said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It quoted the bank as saying that as well as offering the loan, it would help to arrange municipal bond issues and get the region an international credit rating.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
